Um, yes, we started with Pandas, um, and, but like I said, we like to play with the new stuff and we were, um, yeah, happy to see this advertisement by Polars. It's really fast. It has lots of optimization. Honestly, I don't know what it means in reality, but we, uh, switch directly to Polars, um, when we thought it would have the most necessary features. And I think in the beginning we had also some workarounds. I think these days it's quite complete for what we need. So we do just some cleanup mostly on the data. And then, uh, yeah, for that case, it, it is already in state.

